  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w11.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w11.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "記録室は、今日も、古い紙の匂い。司書さんに、湯の噂の裏取りを、頼んでいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "梯子の上から、答えが降ってきた。「ありました。空から来た人たちが」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「束で名を書けば、取り決めを覆せます」「決まりの本にも、ちゃんと載っています」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、その「束」の作り方。決まりの本いわく、要る名前は——百。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……百人。三年で、確かめられた同類は、仲居さんひとり。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w11.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「見分け方は、あるんですか」「諸説あります」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "司書さんが、古い覚え書きを、広げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "来た口は、初物の食べ方が変。雨の日に、空を見る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "来た口は、値札に敏感。……最後のは、身に覚えがある。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "試しに、覚え書きの見分け方を、検証してみた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いちばん大きい子が、初物を丸呑み。「変」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "の判定。生まれも育ちも、この世界の子だ。……この見分け方、当てにならない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "結局、確かなのは、一つだけ。湯だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "湯の中でなら、たぶん、大丈夫。何を話しても。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——長い年月で作った、合言葉だったのだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そうか。手帳の上で、手が止まる。仲居さんの「同じ口の人を探すなら、湯を訪ねなさい」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あれは、宿の宣伝じゃない。——道順だったのだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "司書さんが、地図を広げてくれた。この世界の、湯の場所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街に三つ、山に五つ、砂漠にひとつ。海の底に、ひとつ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あります。良い湯だそうです」この世界、湯にだけは、本気だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w11.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      },
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "百の名前。十の湯。締めの日まで、回り切れるか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳の頁が、初めて、足りなく見えた。耳が、ぴんと立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それが、少し嬉しい。白紙の目標欄は、もう無い。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "まずは、近場から。街でいちばん古い湯の暖簾を、くぐった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "番台のおじいさんが、にっこり笑った。「三年ぶりだね、お客さん」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w11.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "え。三年ぶり? この湯は、初めてです。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ],
      "_units": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w11.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week",
      "_units": 1
    }
  ],
